--- an item written through a record's field (`s.lists[1] = xs`, the field
--- made a list of `[]`s) types the field's items, as an item write into a
--- local does: the field had stayed a list of lists of nothing, compiled
--- as lists of text, which did not build (Rosetta Code, Christofides
--- algorithm)

struct S [lists]

nothing = for i in range[3]
    []
s = S[nothing]
xs = []
xs = push[xs, 5]
s.lists[1] = xs
log[s.lists]
log[len[s.lists[1]] + s.lists[1][0]]
